The `revenexx` and `cap` providers build on Cap, the self-hosted
proof-of-work CAPTCHA by tiagozip:

  Cap
  https://github.com/tiagozip/cap
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The browser solver is the unmodified npm package `@cap.js/widget`, used
through its programmatic mode and installed as a dependency; it carries its
own license file. This package does not show Cap's widget: it draws its own
box and removes the links Cap places in the hidden solver element. RevenexxCaptcha,
the service at captcha.revenexx.com, runs Cap standalone.

The `friendly` provider loads the unmodified npm package
`@friendlycaptcha/sdk` by Friendly Captcha GmbH (MPL-2.0), installed as a
dependency.
